    "D\u0131\u015fa D\u00f6n\u00fck Kanallar": "Izejo\u0161ie kan\u0101li", // EN: Outbound Channels
    "Olaylar uygulaman\u0131n i\u00e7inde kal\u0131r; istersen ayn\u0131 uyar\u0131y\u0131 telefonunun uyar\u0131 merkezine veya Telegram'a da g\u00f6nder. Hi\u00e7biri zorunlu de\u011fil.": "Notikumi paliek lietotn\u0113; ja v\u0113lies, nos\u016bti to pa\u0161u br\u012bdin\u0101jumu savas t\u0101lru\u0146a pazi\u0146ojumu centr\u0101 vai uz Telegram. Neviens no tiem nav oblig\u0101ts.", // EN: Events stay inside the app; if you want, send the same alert to your phone's notification centre or to Telegram. None of these is required.
    "Konu ad\u0131 yaz, hesap gerekmez": "Ievadi t\u0113mas nosaukumu \u2014 konts nav nepiecie\u0161ams", // EN: Enter a topic name — no account needed
    "Konu (topic)": "T\u0113ma", // EN: Topic
    "Bildirimler ntfy.sh \u00fczerinde bu konuya g\u00f6nderilir; konu ad\u0131n\u0131 sadece sen biliyorsan bildirimi sadece sen al\u0131rs\u0131n.": "Br\u012bdin\u0101jumi tiek public\u0113ti \u0161aj\u0101 t\u0113m\u0101 ntfy.sh; ja tikai tu zini t\u0113mas nosaukumu, tikai tu tos sa\u0146emsi.", // EN: Notifications are published to this topic on ntfy.sh; if only you know the topic name, only you receive them.
    "E-posta": "E-pasts", // EN: Email
    "Uyar\u0131lar hesab\u0131n\u0131n e-posta adresine gider": "Br\u012bdin\u0101jumi tiek nos\u016bt\u012bti uz tava konta e-pasta adresi", // EN: Alerts are sent to your account's email address
    "Bulut oturumu a\u00e7\u0131kken kendi adresine g\u00f6nderilir; saklanacak anahtar yok.": "Nos\u016bt\u012bts uz tavu pa\u0161u adresi, kam\u0113r esi pierakst\u012bjies; nek\u0101di nosl\u0113pumi netiek glab\u0101ti lietotn\u0113.", // EN: Sent to your own address while signed in; no secrets are stored in the app.
    "G\u00f6nderilecek adres": "Sa\u0146\u0113m\u0113js", // EN: Recipient
    "Cihazlar Aras\u0131 Bildirim": "Pazi\u0146ojumi starp ier\u012bc\u0113m", // EN: Cross-device Notifications
    "Aile \u00fcyesinin uyar\u0131s\u0131, o ki\u015finin uygulamas\u0131 kapal\u0131yken de bildirim merkezine d\u00fc\u015fer": "\u0122imenes locek\u013ca br\u012bdin\u0101jums ierodas pazi\u0146ojumu centr\u0101 pat tad, ja lietotne ir aizv\u0113rta", // EN: A family member's alert arrives in the notification centre even when the app is closed
    "Di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin ve kendi di\u011fer cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n bildirim merkezine gider; al\u0131c\u0131 bu kanal\u0131 kendi cihaz\u0131nda a\u00e7m\u0131\u015f olmal\u0131.": "Non\u0101k citos locek\u013cu un j\u016bsu citos ier\u012b\u010du pazi\u0146ojumu centros; sa\u0146\u0113m\u0113jam \u0161is kan\u0101ls ir j\u0101iesp\u0113jo sav\u0101 ier\u012bc\u0113.", // EN: Goes to other members' and your other devices' notification centres; the recipient must have this channel enabled on their device.
    "Kendi sunucuna JSON POST \u2014 geli\u015fmi\u015f": "JSON POST uz j\u016bsu serveri \u2014 uzlabots", // EN: JSON POST to your own server — advanced
    "HTTPS adresi": "HTTPS URL", // EN: HTTPS URL
    "Yaln\u0131zca HTTPS kabul edilir; her olay {source, id, title, detail, ts} olarak g\u00f6nderilir.": "Tiek pie\u0146emts tikai HTTPS; katrs notikums tiek nos\u016bt\u012bts k\u0101 {source, id, title, detail, ts}.", // EN: Only HTTPS is accepted; each event is sent as {source, id, title, detail, ts}.
