    "Anahtar buluta y\u00fcklenmez; di\u011fer cihazlarda tekrar girmen gerekir.": "Tokens nekad netiek aug\u0161upiel\u0101d\u0113ts m\u0101kon\u012b; ievadiet to atk\u0101rtoti cit\u0101s ier\u012bc\u0113s.", // EN: The token is never uploaded to the cloud; re-enter it on other devices.
