    ". Ev konumu, cihazlar\u0131n\u0131n do\u011fru e\u015fle\u015fmesi ve konum tabanl\u0131 otomasyon i\u00e7in gerekli.": ". J\u016bsu m\u0101jas atra\u0161an\u0101s vieta ir nepiecie\u0161ama, lai nodro\u0161in\u0101tu pareizu ier\u012bces savietojam\u012bbu un darb\u012bbas, kas balst\u012btas uz atra\u0161an\u0101s vietu.", // EN: . Your home location is needed for correct device matching and location-based automations.
