    "Aboneli\u011fin hemen sona erer ve bir sonraki \u00f6deme al\u0131nmaz.": "J\u016bsu abonements tiek p\u0101rtraukts uzreiz un turpm\u0101ka maks\u0101juma netiks \u0146emts.", // EN: Your subscription ends immediately and no further payment is taken.
