    "Aboneli\u011finiz yok \u2014 t\u00fcm \u00f6zellikler \u015fu an \u00fccretsiz. NEXUS+ yak\u0131nda.": "Jums nav abonementa \u2014 \u0161obr\u012bd visas funkcijas ir bez maksas. NEXUS+ dr\u012bzum\u0101.", // EN: You don't have a subscription — every feature is free right now. NEXUS+ is coming soon.
