    "Adres biliyorsan tek tek yaz, bilmiyorsan modem a\u011f\u0131n\u0131n \u00f6n ekini b\u0131rak (192.168.1 gibi) \u2014 NEXUS 254 adresi birlikte yoklar.": "Ja zin\u0101t adresi, ierakstiet to; ja n\u0113, atst\u0101jiet sava mar\u0161rut\u0113t\u0101ja t\u012bkla prefiksu (piem\u0113ram, 192.168.1) \u2014 NEXUS p\u0101rbauda visas 254 adreses.", // EN: If you know the address, type it; if not, leave your router network prefix (like 192.168.1) — NEXUS checks all 254 addresses.
