    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "\u0100tras taup\u012b\u0161anas pl\u016bsmas viedajiem spraud\u0146iem un ener\u0123iju taupo\u0161\u0101m ier\u012bc\u0113m.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Apvienojiet viedos spraud\u0146us un ener\u0123iju pat\u0113r\u0113jo\u0161\u0101s ier\u012bces vien\u0101 viet\u0101. Izveidojiet t\u016bl\u012bt\u0113jus taup\u012b\u0161anas profilus un iepl\u0101notas ekodarb\u012bbas.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Izveidojiet ener\u0123ijas taup\u012b\u0161anas paneli, kas p\u0101rvalda viedos spraud\u0146us un ener\u0123iju pat\u0113r\u0113jo\u0161as ier\u012bces. Pievienojiet \u0101tru izsl\u0113g\u0161anu, ekoprofilus, iepl\u0101notu taup\u012b\u0161anu un lieto\u0161anas kopsavilkumu.", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
