    "Bildirimler": "Pazi\u0146ojumi", // EN: Notifications
    "Bildirimler 2 saat sessiz": "Pazi\u0146ojumi klus\u0101 re\u017e\u012bm\u0101 2 stundas", // EN: Notifications silent for 2 hours
    "Bildirimler a\u00e7\u0131k": "Pazi\u0146ojumi iesl\u0113gti", // EN: Notifications on
