    "Bulut hesab\u0131na ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Nebija iesp\u0113jams sasniegt m\u0101ko\u0146a kontu. P\u0101rbaudiet interneta savienojumu.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud account. Check your internet connection.
    "Buluta ula\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131. \u0130nternet ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "Nebija iesp\u0113jams sasniegt m\u0101ko\u0146a pakalpojumu. P\u0101rbaudiet interneta savienojumu.", // EN: Couldn't reach the cloud. Check your internet connection.
    "Bunu tam \u00e7\u00f6zemedim. A\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki formdan ekibimize geri bildirim g\u00f6nderirsen en k\u0131sa s\u00fcrede d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f yapal\u0131m; ya da \"Tam sohbeti a\u00e7\" ile devam edebilirsin.": "Es to nevar\u0113ju piln\u012bb\u0101 atrisin\u0101t. S\u016btiet atsauksmes m\u016bsu komandai, izmantojot zem\u0101k eso\u0161o formu, un m\u0113s atbild\u0113sim jums p\u0113c iesp\u0113jas \u0101tr\u0101k, vai turpiniet ar \"Atv\u0113rt pilnu t\u0113rz\u0113\u0161anu\".", // EN: I couldn't fully solve that. Send our team feedback with the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as we can, or continue with "Open full chat".
