    "Canl\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fc g\u00f6stermek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce kamera e\u015fle\u015ftir.": "Vispirms pievienojiet kameru, lai par\u0101d\u012btu tie\u0161raides video.", // EN: Pair a camera first to show live video.
