    "Se\u00e7ilen dosya bir resim de\u011fil.": "Izv\u0113l\u0113tais fails nav att\u0113ls.", // EN: The selected file is not an image.
    "Foto\u011fraf \u00e7ok b\u00fcy\u00fck kald\u0131; daha k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck bir resim dene.": "Foto joproj\u0101m ir p\u0101r\u0101k liels; m\u0113\u0123iniet maz\u0101ku att\u0113lu.", // EN: The photo is still too large; try a smaller image.
