    "Cihaz uyar\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131, \u00e7a\u011fr\u0131 kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131 ve \u00f6nemli durum mesajlar\u0131n\u0131 tek merkezden takip edin.": "Izsekojiet ier\u012bces br\u012bdin\u0101jumus, zvanu \u017eurn\u0101lus un svar\u012bgus statusa zi\u0146ojumus no viena centra.", // EN: Track device alerts, call logs and important status messages from one center.
