    "Masa\u00fcst\u00fc Uygulamas\u0131": "Darbvirsmas lietotne", // EN: Desktop App
    "S\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc g\u00f6r\u00fcnt\u00fcle, yeni s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc buradan kontrol et ve y\u00fckle.": "Skat\u012bt versiju, p\u0101rbaud\u012bt jaunu versiju \u0161eit un instal\u0113t to.", // EN: View the version, check for a new version here and install it.
