    "Yeniden Ba\u015flat ve Y\u00fckle": "Restart\u0113t un instal\u0113t", // EN: Restart and Install
    "Cihazlar\u0131n durumu de\u011fi\u015fti\u011finde di\u011fer senaryolar\u0131 otomatik olarak tetikleyin.": "Autom\u0101tiski aktiviz\u0113t citus scen\u0101rijus, kad j\u016bsu ier\u012b\u010du statuss main\u0101s.", // EN: Trigger other scenarios automatically when your devices' status changes.
    "Cihazlar\u0131na dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edin, stratejilerle otomatik tasarruf et.": "Ieg\u016bstiet ieskatus par sav\u0101m ier\u012bc\u0113m un saglab\u0101jiet autom\u0101tiski ar strat\u0113\u0123ij\u0101m.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and save automatically with strategies.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 otomatik tarama, QR kod, kurulum kodu ya da manuel katalog ile ekleyebilirsin.": "J\u016bs varat pievienot savas ier\u012bces ar autom\u0101tisko sken\u0113\u0161anu, QR kodu, uzst\u0101d\u012b\u0161anas kodu vai manu\u0101lo katalogu.", // EN: You can add your devices with automatic scan, QR code, setup code or the manual catalog.
    "Cihazlar\u0131n\u0131za dair i\u00e7g\u00f6r\u00fcler edinin ve enerji ipu\u00e7lar\u0131 al\u0131n.": "Ieg\u016bstiet ieskatus par sav\u0101m ier\u012bc\u0113m un ener\u0123ijas padomus.", // EN: Get insights about your devices and energy tips.
    "Cihaz\u0131 Do\u011frula": "P\u0101rbaud\u012bt ier\u012bci", // EN: Verify Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 Se\u00e7": "Izv\u0113l\u0113ties ier\u012bci", // EN: Select Device
    "Cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r": "No\u0146emt ier\u012bci", // EN: Remove device
    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "K\u0101p\u0113c mana ier\u012bce tiek r\u0101d\u012bta k\u0101 bezsaist\u0113?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Ievadiet ier\u012bces IP adresi, un NEXUS noteiks, kuru protokolu t\u0101 izmanto.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "P\u0101rbaudiet ier\u012bces Wi-Fi savienojumu un savu mar\u0161rut\u0113t\u0101ju. Ja probl\u0113ma turpin\u0101s, no\u0146emiet ier\u012bci un pievienojiet to atk\u0101rtoti. So\u013ci: Ier\u012bces > izv\u0113lieties ier\u012bci > No\u0146emt.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "P\u0101rbaudiet ier\u012bces Wi-Fi savienojumu un savu mar\u0161rut\u0113t\u0101ju. Ja probl\u0113ma turpin\u0101s, no\u0146emiet ier\u012bci no NEXUS lietotnes un pievienojiet to atk\u0101rtoti.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Ja j\u016bsu ier\u012bce nepar\u0101d\u0101s, izmantojiet QR sken\u0113\u0161anu vai uzst\u0101d\u012b\u0161anas kodu. J\u016bs varat atv\u0113rt pal\u012bdz\u012bbas lapu atbalstam un vadl\u012bnij\u0101m.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "J\u016bsu ier\u012bces atra\u0161an\u0101s vietas (GPS) pakalpojums ir izsl\u0113gts. Iesl\u0113dziet to un m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum servisini desteklemiyor.": "J\u016bsu ier\u012bce neatbalsta atra\u0161an\u0101s vietas pakalpojumus.", // EN: Your device doesn't support location services.
    "Cihaz\u0131n listede yok mu? Geri bildirim g\u00f6nder": "Ier\u012bce nav sarakst\u0101? S\u016bt\u012bt atsauksmes", // EN: Device not on the list? Send feedback
    "Cihaz\u0131n yerel anahtar\u0131 gerekir \u2014 yak\u0131nda": "Nepiecie\u0161ama ier\u012bces lok\u0101l\u0101 atsl\u0113ga \u2014 dr\u012bzum\u0101", // EN: Needs the device's local key — coming soon
