    "D\u0131\u015far\u0131daki polen seviyesi artt\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\u00e7in NEXUS hava temizleme modunu orta seviyeye ald\u0131.": "T\u0101 k\u0101 \u0101r\u0113j\u0101 ziedputek\u0161\u0146u l\u012bmenis palielin\u0101j\u0101s, NEXUS iestat\u012bja gaisa att\u012br\u012b\u0161anu uz vid\u0113ju.", // EN: Because outdoor pollen levels rose, NEXUS set air purification to medium.
