    "Evde a\u00e7\u0131k kalan t\u00fcm ayd\u0131nlatma gruplar\u0131n\u0131 kapat.": "Izsl\u0113dziet visus m\u0101j\u0101s atst\u0101t\u0101s apgaismojuma grupas.", // EN: Turn off all lighting groups left on at home.
    "Evde ve D\u0131\u015far\u0131da": "M\u0101j\u0101s un prom", // EN: At Home and Away
    "Evde yok": "Prom", // EN: Away
    "Evde yokken": "Kad esat prom", // EN: When away
    "Evdeki ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 oda bazl\u0131 tek bir ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7inde y\u00f6net. A\u00e7 kapa, parlakl\u0131k, renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve h\u0131zl\u0131 sahne k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ayn\u0131 uygulamada toplans\u0131n.": "P\u0101rvaldiet gaismas sav\u0101 m\u0101jas istab\u0101 pa istab\u0101m vien\u0101 pl\u016bsm\u0101. Iesl\u0113gt/izsl\u0113gt, spilgtums, kr\u0101sas temperat\u016bra un \u0101tr\u0101s skatu sa\u012bsnes vien\u0101 lietotn\u0113.", // EN: Manage the lights in your home room by room in one flow. On/off, brightness, color temperature and quick scene shortcuts in one app.
    "Evdeki cihazlara g\u00f6re haz\u0131r komutlar, h\u0131zl\u0131 otomasyonlar ve ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulama \u00f6nerileri ver.": "Sniedziet gatavas komandas, \u0101tras automatiz\u0101cijas un gudras lietot\u0146u ieteikumus, pamatojoties uz ier\u012bc\u0113m m\u0101j\u0101s.", // EN: Give ready commands, quick automations and smart app suggestions based on the devices at home.
    "Evdeki klima ve termostatlar\u0131 tek panelde y\u00f6neten bir iklim konfor uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. S\u0131cakl\u0131k ayar\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131 mod se\u00e7enekleri, eko modu ve oda bazl\u0131 kontrol aksiyonlar\u0131 olsun.": "Izveidojiet klimata komforta lietotni, kas p\u0101rvalda gaisa kondicionierus un termostatus j\u016bsu m\u0101j\u0101s no viena pane\u013ca. Iek\u013caujiet temperat\u016bras kontroli, \u0101tr\u0101s re\u017e\u012bmus, ekonomisko re\u017e\u012bmu un darb\u012bbas atsevi\u0161\u0137\u0101s telp\u0101s.", // EN: Create a climate comfort app that manages the ACs and thermostats in your home from one panel. Include temperature control, quick modes, eco mode and room-based actions.
    "Evimdeki cihazlar\u0131n durumu nedir?": "K\u0101ds ir manu ier\u012b\u010du statuss?", // EN: What is the status of my devices?
    "Evden Uzakta": "Nav m\u0101j\u0101s", // EN: Away from Home
    "Evden Uzakta Senaryosu": "Nav m\u0101j\u0101s skats", // EN: Away from Home Scene
    "Evden ayr\u0131l\u0131rken enerji ve g\u00fcvenlik kontrollerini toparlar.": "Veic ener\u0123ijas un dro\u0161\u012bbas p\u0101rbaudes, kad izbraucat no m\u0101j\u0101m.", // EN: Wraps up energy and security checks when you leave home.
    "Evden uzakta": "Nav m\u0101j\u0101s", // EN: Away from home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f": "Izbraucot no m\u0101j\u0101m", // EN: Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Kontrol\u00fc": "Izbrauk\u0161anas p\u0101rbaude", // EN: Leaving Home Check
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f Senaryosu": "Izbraucot no m\u0101j\u0101m skats", // EN: Leaving Home Scene
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f \u00d6zeti": "Izbrauk\u0161anas kopsavilkums", // EN: Leaving Home Summary
    "Evden \u00c7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131 Tamamla": "Pabeigt izbrauk\u0161anu no m\u0101j\u0101m", // EN: Finish Leaving Home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilit durumunu ve enerji ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6steren bir \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f kontrol\u00fc uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme butonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Izveidojiet izbrauk\u0161anas p\u0101rbaudes lietotni, kas r\u0101da iesl\u0113gt\u0101s ier\u012bces, sl\u0113dzenes statusu un ener\u0123ijas iestat\u012bjumus vien\u0101 ekr\u0101n\u0101. Pievienojiet \u0101tr\u0101s izsl\u0113g\u0161anas un dro\u0161\u012bbas aktiviz\u0113\u0161anas pogas.", // EN: Create a leaving-home check app that shows devices left on, lock status and energy settings on one screen. Add quick shut-off and security activation buttons.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ak\u0131\u015fta kontrol edin.": "P\u0101rbaudiet iesl\u0113gt\u0101s ier\u012bces, sl\u0113dzenes un ener\u0123ijas statusu vien\u0101 pl\u016bsm\u0101, izbraucot no m\u0101j\u0101m.", // EN: Check devices left on, locks and energy status in one flow when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131karken a\u00e7\u0131k cihazlar\u0131, kilitleri ve enerji durumunu tek ekranda g\u00f6ster.": "Par\u0101di ier\u012bces, kas atst\u0101tas iesl\u0113gtas, sl\u0113dzenes un ener\u0123ijas statusu vien\u0101 ekr\u0101n\u0101, kad dodies prom no m\u0101j\u0101m.", // EN: Show devices left on, locks and energy status on one screen when leaving home.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce a\u00e7\u0131k kalan \u0131\u015f\u0131k, priz, klima ve g\u00fcvenlik ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 tek panelde g\u00f6r. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma ve g\u00fcvenlik aktif etme ad\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131 tek ak\u0131\u015fa topla.": "Skaties gaismas, kontaktligzdas, kondicionierus un dro\u0161\u012bbas iestat\u012bjumus, kas paliku\u0161i iesl\u0113gti pirms do\u0161an\u0101s prom no m\u0101j\u0101m, vien\u0101 pane\u013ca skat\u0101. Apkopo \u0101tras izsl\u0113g\u0161anas un dro\u0161\u012bbas aktiviz\u0113\u0161anas so\u013cus vien\u0101 pl\u016bsm\u0101.", // EN: See lights, plugs, ACs and security settings left on before leaving home, on one panel. Gather quick shut-off and security activation steps into one flow.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kmadan \u00f6nce son kontrolleri yapal\u0131m.": "Veicim gal\u012bgo p\u0101rbaudi pirms izie\u0161anas.", // EN: Let's do the final checks before you leave.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otom...": "Autom\u0101tiski izsl\u0113dz gaismas p\u0113c do\u0161an\u0101s prom no m\u0101j\u0101m.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leav...
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat": "Autom\u0101tiski izsl\u0113dz gaismas p\u0113c do\u0161an\u0101s prom un iesl\u0113dz t\u0101s, kad atgriezies.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n ve eve d\u00f6nd\u00fckten sonra a\u00e7\u0131n.": "Autom\u0101tiski izsl\u0113dz kondicionieri, kad m\u0101j\u0101s neviens nav, lai izvair\u012btos no liekas pat\u0113ri\u0146a.", // EN: Turn off the lights automatically after you leave and turn them on when you return.
    "Evde kimse yokken klimay\u0131 otomatik olarak kapat\u0131n, gereksiz t\u00fcketimi \u00f6nleyin.": "Autom\u0101tiski p\u0101rtrauc str\u0101vas padevi ier\u012bc\u0113m gaidst\u0101ves re\u017e\u012bm\u0101 izv\u0113l\u0113taj\u0101 laik\u0101 nakt\u012b.", // EN: Turn off the air conditioner automatically when nobody is home and avoid needless consumption.
    "Gece belirledi\u011fin saatte bekleme modundaki cihazlar\u0131n g\u00fcc\u00fcn\u00fc otomatik olarak kesin.": "Do\u0161an\u0101s prom no m\u0101j\u0101m", // EN: Automatically cut power to devices on standby at the time you choose at night.
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Izsl\u0113dz kontaktligzdu, atst\u0101jot m\u0101jas", // EN: When leaving home
    "Evden \u00e7\u0131k\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda prizi kapat": "Do\u0161an\u0101s prom no m\u0101j\u0101m", // EN: Turn off the plug when leaving home
