    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Nospiediet apa\u013co pogu uz tilta, p\u0113c tam m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Nospiediet apa\u013co pogu uz tilta aug\u0161da\u013cas, p\u0113c tam pieskarieties \u201cSavienot tiltu\u201d 30 sekun\u017eu laik\u0101.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "Neizdev\u0101s savienoties ar tiltu. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka atrodaties taj\u0101 pa\u0161\u0101 t\u012bkl\u0101, un m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
