    "Matter cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 eklemek i\u00e7in bir Matter denetleyicisi gerekir; NEXUS bu deste\u011fi hen\u00fcz sunmuyor. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011flan\u0131yorsa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle ekleyebilirsin.": "Lai pievienotu Matter ier\u012bces, nepiecie\u0161ams Matter kontrolieris, kuru NEXUS v\u0113l nepied\u0101v\u0101. Ja ier\u012bce savienojas caur Wi-Fi, j\u016bs to varat pievienot no sava lok\u0101l\u0101 t\u012bkla p\u0113c t\u0101s IP adreses.", // EN: Adding Matter devices needs a Matter controller, which NEXUS doesn't offer yet. If the device connects over Wi-Fi, you can add it from your local network by its IP address.
