    "NEXUS AI al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenir ve evinizi size \u00f6zel m\u00fckemmel bir ya\u015fam alan\u0131na d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcr\u00fcr.": "NEXUS AI apg\u016bst j\u016bsu ieradumus un p\u0101rv\u0113r\u0161 j\u016bsu m\u0101ju par dz\u012bvojamu telpu, kas izveidota tie\u0161i jums.", // EN: NEXUS AI learns your habits and turns your home into a living space made just for you.
    "NEXUS AI ile her \u015feyi olu\u015fturun": "Radiet jebko ar NEXUS AI", // EN: Create anything with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile sohbet et": "Sarakstieties ar NEXUS AI", // EN: Chat with NEXUS AI
    "NEXUS AI ile yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z her g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme puan kullan\u0131r. Puanlar her g\u00fcn yenilenir.": "Katrs dialogs ar NEXUS AI izmanto punktus. Punkti tiek atjaunoti katru dienu.", // EN: Each conversation with NEXUS AI uses points. Points renew every day.
