    "NEXUS Y\u00f6nlendiriliyor...": "J\u016bs varat pievienoties, ievadot \u0161o kodu sada\u013c\u0101 \"Pievienoties m\u0101jai\" NEXUS.", // EN: Redirecting to NEXUS...
    "NEXUS i\u00e7inde \"Bir Eve Kat\u0131l\" alan\u0131na bu kodu girerek kat\u0131labilirsin.": "Vadiet savus NEXUS scen\u0101rijus ar balsi caur Siri da\u017eu sekun\u017eu laik\u0101.", // EN: You can join by entering this code in "Join a Home" inside NEXUS.
    "NEXUS senaryolar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Siri komutlar\u0131yla saniyeler i\u00e7inde sesle \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131n.": "NEXUS prioritat\u012bvi darbojas lok\u0101li: j\u016bsu ier\u012bces dati paliek \u0161aj\u0101 ier\u012bc\u0113, ier\u012bces komandas tiek s\u016bt\u012btas tie\u0161i pa j\u016bsu viet\u0113jo t\u012bklu, un nekas netiek kop\u012bgots ar tre\u0161aj\u0101m person\u0101m.", // EN: Run your NEXUS scenarios by voice with Siri in seconds.
    "NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r: cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r, cihaz komutlar\u0131 do\u011frudan yerel a\u011fdan gider ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "NEXUS \u00b7 Piesl\u0113gties", // EN: NEXUS is local-first: your device data stays on this device, device commands go straight over your local network, and nothing is shared with third parties.
