    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "\u0160aj\u0101 adres\u0113 ir ier\u012bce, bet t\u0101 neizmanto NEXUS protokolu.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "\u0160\u012b ier\u012bce jau ir pievienota.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Savairot un pievienot", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "Savienojuma kods nav der\u012bgs. Ievadiet 11 ciparu kodu vai QR saturu, kas s\u0101kas ar MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Ievadiet \u0161o kodu NEXUS darbvirsmas lietotn\u0113. Ja ier\u012bce ir Wi-Fi t\u012bkl\u0101, to var pievienot ar\u012b, izmantojot viet\u0113jo t\u012bklu p\u0113c IP adreses.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "Ier\u012bce tiek mekl\u0113ta vien\u0101 t\u012bkl\u0101 un savienota. Tas var aiz\u0146emt l\u012bdz vienai min\u016btei; ier\u012bcei j\u0101b\u016bt iesl\u0113gtai un savieno\u0161anas re\u017e\u012bm\u0101.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ier\u012bce nav atrasta vai to nav iesp\u0113jams savienot. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka t\u0101 ir pievienota tam pa\u0161am t\u012bklam, iesl\u0113gta un p\u0101rejas re\u017e\u012bm\u0101.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "Ier\u012bce nav atrasta. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka t\u0101 ir pievienota tam pa\u0161am t\u012bklam, iesl\u0113gta un p\u0101rejas re\u017e\u012bm\u0101. J\u016bsu datora ugunsm\u016bris var blo\u0137\u0113t atbildes no ier\u012bc\u0113m lok\u0101laj\u0101 t\u012bkl\u0101.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "Ier\u012bci nevar\u0113ja savienot. P\u0101rbaudiet savieno\u0161anas kodu un vai ier\u012bce ir p\u0101rejas re\u017e\u012bm\u0101.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "Ier\u012bce ir savienota, bet tai nav funkciju, ko NEXUS var\u0113tu kontrol\u0113t.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Ier\u012bce neatsaucas. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka t\u0101 ir iesl\u0113gta un pievienota tam pa\u0161am t\u012bklam.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
