    "TV odas\u0131 i\u00e7in k\u0131s\u0131k parlakl\u0131kta sinema sahnesi olu\u015ftur.": "Izveidot v\u0101ju kinote\u0101tra ainu TV istabai.", // EN: Create a dimmed cinema scene for the TV room.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Izveidot kinote\u0101tra re\u017e\u012bma lietotni TV un multivides ier\u012bc\u0113m. Iek\u013caut filmas s\u0101k\u0161anu, ska\u013cumu, apk\u0101rt\u0113j\u0101s gaismas un uzman\u012bbu nov\u0113rsto vakara izklaides \u012bsce\u013cus.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Viena piesk\u0101riena izklaides panelis TV un multivides ier\u012bc\u0113m.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "TV, ska\u013cru\u0146i un izklaides ier\u012bces", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Apvienojiet TV, multivides kasti un apk\u0101rt\u0113j\u0101s gaismas vien\u0101 darb\u012bb\u0101. Padariet vienk\u0101r\u0161u filmas s\u0101k\u0161anu, nakts re\u017e\u012bmu un uzman\u012bbu nov\u0113rsto izklaides ainu iestat\u012b\u0161anu.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "Protams! Es varu sagatavot lielisku viedo scen\u0101riju jums. Vai var\u0113tu sniegt da\u017eas deta\u013cas? Piem\u0113ram: \"Start\u0113t kafijas autom\u0101tu, kad es mostos\" vai \"Piln\u012bb\u0101 aptum\u0161ot gaismas, kad es skatos filmu\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
