    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Izv\u0113lieties ier\u012bces", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "Atveriet \u0161o ekr\u0101nu NEXUS lietotn\u0113 sav\u0101 iPhone; j\u016bsu ainas ir uzskait\u012btas zem\u0101k, un j\u016bs varat iestat\u012bt Siri \u012bsce\u013cu katrai.", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
    "Bu ba\u011flant\u0131 NEXUS'u a\u00e7ar ve senaryoyu hemen \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "1. Kop\u0113t ainas saiti", // EN: This link opens NEXUS and runs the scene right away.
    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "\u0160\u012b saite atver NEXUS un t\u016bl\u012bt izpilda ainu.", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "2. Izveidot jaunu \u012bsce\u013cu lietotn\u0113 Shortcuts", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
    "Kestirmeler uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7": "Izv\u0113lieties \u201cPievienot darb\u012bbu\u201d \u203a \u201cAtv\u0113rt URL\u201d un iel\u012bm\u0113jiet saiti, ko kop\u0113j\u0101t.", // EN: Open the Shortcuts app
    "Cihazlar\u0131na uyan haz\u0131r otomasyonlardan birini tek dokunu\u015fla ekle.": "Pievienojiet gatavu automatiz\u0101ciju, kas atbilst j\u016bsu ier\u012bc\u0113m ar vienu piesk\u0101rienu.", // EN: Add a ready-made automation that fits your devices with one tap.
    "Belirli bir saatte; her g\u00fcn, hafta i\u00e7i ya da hafta sonu": "Noteikt\u0101 laik\u0101; katru dienu, darba dien\u0101s vai ned\u0113\u013cas nogal\u0113s", // EN: At a set time; every day, on weekdays or at weekends
