    "Kap\u0131 veya Pencere A\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kad durvis vai logs tiek atv\u0113rts", // EN: When a Door or Window Opens
    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kad durvju/logu sensors tiek atv\u0113rts", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Kad d\u016bmu, pl\u016bdu vai g\u0101zes sensors rada trauksmi", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Ier\u012bces un sensoru aktivatori par\u0101d\u012bsies \u0161eit, tikl\u012bdz pievienosiet piem\u0113rotu ier\u012bci.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
