    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Kad temperat\u016bra, v\u0113j\u0161 vai lietus p\u0101rsniedz slieksni", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
