    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Aizsl\u0113gt durvis", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Iesl\u0113dz visas gaismas piln\u0101 spilgtum\u0101.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Izsl\u0113dz visas gaismas.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Iesl\u0113dz gaismas piln\u0101 spilgtum\u0101 dienasgaismas ton\u012b.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Iestata gaismas 85% neitr\u0101l\u0101 ton\u012b un izsl\u0113dz TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Iestata gaismas 40% silta ton\u012b.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Katru vakaru 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Iesl\u0113dz gaisa kondicionieri uz 20\u00b0 un iestata termostatu uz 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Iestata termostatu uz 24\u00b0 komforta re\u017e\u012bmu.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Darba dien\u0101s 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Atver visus aizkarus un \u017eal\u016bzijas.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Katru dienu saull\u0113kt\u0101", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Aizver visus aizkarus un \u017eal\u016bzijas.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Katru dienu saulriet\u0101", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Aizsl\u0113dz visus viedos sl\u0113dzenes (sl\u0113dzenes nekad netiek atsl\u0113gtas).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Izsl\u0113dz gaismas un TV; atst\u0101j kontaktligzdas un gaisa kondicionieri iesl\u0113gtus.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Iesl\u0113gt vai izsl\u0113gt ier\u012bci", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Nos\u016bta komandu izv\u0113l\u0113tajai ier\u012bcei.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
    "Hangi cihaz?": "Kura ier\u012bce?", // EN: Which device?
    "A\u00e7\u0131ls\u0131n": "Iesl\u0113gt", // EN: Turn on
    "Kapans\u0131n": "Izsl\u0113gt", // EN: Turn off
    "Kontrol edilecek cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7.": "Izv\u0113lies ier\u012bci, kuru kontrol\u0113t.", // EN: Choose the device to control.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava kalitesini, s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve nemi g\u00f6r; ar\u0131t\u0131c\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6net.": "Skat\u012bt gaisa kvalit\u0101ti, temperat\u016bru un mitrumu, ko m\u0113ra j\u016bsu sensori, un kontrol\u0113t gaisa att\u012br\u012bt\u0101ju.", // EN: See the air quality, temperature and humidity your sensors measure, and control your purifier.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve klimay\u0131 g\u00fcne ba\u015flarken tek dokunu\u015fla haz\u0131rla.": "Sagatavojiet gaismas, aizkarus un gaisa kondicionieri dienai ar vienu piesk\u0101rienu.", // EN: Get lights, curtains and the AC ready for the day with one tap.
    "Eve girerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131, perdeleri ve iklimi birlikte a\u00e7.": "Iesl\u0113gt gaismas, aizkarus un klimatu kop\u0101, kad atn\u0101c m\u0101j\u0101s.", // EN: Turn on lights, curtains and climate together when you get home.
    "Uzun s\u00fcre evde yokken cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00fcvenli ve tasarruflu konuma al.": "Ielieciet savas ier\u012bces dro\u0161\u0101, ener\u0123iju taupo\u0161\u0101 re\u017e\u012bm\u0101, kam\u0113r esat ilgsto\u0161i prom.", // EN: Put your devices into a safe, energy-saving state while you are away for long.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 k\u0131s, perdeleri kapat ve TV'yi a\u00e7.": "Samazini gaismu, aizver aizkarus un iesl\u0113dz televizoru.", // EN: Dim the lights, close the curtains and turn on the TV.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeni ba\u015flat ya da \u015farj istasyonuna g\u00f6nder.": "S\u0101c savu robotu putek\u013cus\u016bc\u0113ju vai nos\u016bti to atpaka\u013c uz dokstaciju.", // EN: Start your robot vacuum or send it back to its dock.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitle, perdeleri kapat ve evi geceye haz\u0131rla.": "Aizsl\u0113dz durvis, aizver aizkarus un sagatavo m\u0101ju nakts laik\u0101.", // EN: Lock the door, close the curtains and get the house ready for the night.
    "Ekledi\u011fin kameralar\u0131n durumunu ve gizlilik ayar\u0131n\u0131 tek ekranda g\u00f6r.": "Skaties savas kameras statusu un priv\u0101tuma iestat\u012bjumus vien\u0101 ekr\u0101n\u0101.", // EN: See the status and privacy setting of your cameras on one screen.
    "Evdeyken kameralar\u0131n i\u00e7in gizlilik modunu tek yerden a\u00e7 ya da kapat.": "Iesl\u0113dz vai izsl\u0113dz priv\u0101tuma re\u017e\u012bmu sav\u0101m kamer\u0101m vienuviet, kam\u0113r esi m\u0101j\u0101s.", // EN: Turn privacy mode for your cameras on or off from one place while you are home.
    "Bug\u00fcn hangi otomasyonun ne zaman \u00e7al\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6r.": "Skaties, kura automatiz\u0101cija darbojas \u0161odien.", // EN: See which automation runs when today.
    "Ev halk\u0131yla notlar\u0131 ve yap\u0131lacaklar\u0131 payla\u015f.": "Dalies ar piez\u012bm\u0113m un uzdevumiem ar savu m\u0101jsaimniec\u012bbu.", // EN: Share notes and to-dos with your household.
    "Sens\u00f6rlerinin \u00f6l\u00e7t\u00fc\u011f\u00fc hava, nem ve s\u0131cakl\u0131ktan evinin sa\u011fl\u0131k \u00f6zetini g\u00f6r.": "Skaties sava m\u0101jok\u013ca vesel\u012bbas kopsavilkumu p\u0113c gaisa, mitruma un temperat\u016bras, ko m\u0113ra tavi sensori.", // EN: See your home's health summary from the air, humidity and temperature your sensors measure.
    "Ekledi\u011fin cihazlar\u0131n yerel a\u011fdan ula\u015f\u0131labilir olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol et.": "P\u0101rbaudi, vai tavi ier\u012bces ir sasniedzamas caur viet\u0113jo t\u012bklu.", // EN: Check whether your devices can be reached over your local network.
