    "Yedekle ve Geri Y\u00fckle": "Rezerves kopija un atjauno\u0161ana", // EN: Backup & Restore
    "Cihaz listesi, otomasyonlar, senaryolar ve ayarlar bir dosyaya kaydedilir. Cihaz parolalar\u0131, yerel anahtarlar, Telegram anahtar\u0131 ve oturum bilgisi yede\u011fe girmez.": "J\u016bsu ier\u012b\u010du saraksts, automatiz\u0101cijas, ainas un iestat\u012bjumi tiek saglab\u0101ti fail\u0101. Ier\u012b\u010du paroles, lok\u0101l\u0101s atsl\u0113gas, Telegram tok\u0113ns un j\u016bsu sesija nav iek\u013cauta rezerves kopij\u0101.", // EN: Your device list, automations, scenes and settings are saved to a file. Device passwords, local keys, the Telegram token and your session are not included in the backup.
    "Yede\u011fi d\u0131\u015fa aktar": "Eksport\u0113t rezerves kopiju", // EN: Export backup
    "Hata Raporu": "K\u013c\u016bdu zi\u0146ojums", // EN: Error Report
    "Uygulamada olu\u015fan hatalar otomatik ve anonim olarak (ki\u015fisel veri olmadan) bize iletilir. \u0130stersen a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan kapatabilirsin.": "K\u013c\u016bdas, kas notiek lietotn\u0113, tiek nos\u016bt\u012btas mums autom\u0101tiski un anon\u012bmi (bez personiskiem datiem). J\u016bs varat to izsl\u0113gt zem\u0101k.", // EN: Errors that happen in the app are sent to us automatically and anonymously (no personal data). You can turn it off below.
    "Anonim Hata Raporu G\u00f6nder": "S\u016bt\u012bt anon\u012bmus k\u013c\u016bdu zi\u0146ojumus", // EN: Send Anonymous Error Reports
    "Anonim hata raporu g\u00f6nder": "S\u016bt\u012bt anon\u012bmus k\u013c\u016bdu zi\u0146ojumus", // EN: Send anonymous error reports
    "Yedekten geri y\u00fckle": "Atjaunot no rezerves kopijas", // EN: Restore from backup
    "E\u015fle\u015fmi\u015f cihazlar\u0131na g\u00f6re haz\u0131r; tek dokunu\u015fla eklenir.": "Gatavs j\u016bsu piesaist\u012btaj\u0101m ier\u012bc\u0113m; pievienots ar vienu piesk\u0101rienu.", // EN: Ready for your paired devices; added with a single tap.
    "Senin i\u00e7in haz\u0131r": "Gatavs jums", // EN: Ready for you
