    "Temay\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir": "Main\u012bt t\u0113mu", // EN: Change theme
    "L\u00fctfen ge\u00e7erli bir e-posta gir.": "L\u016bdzu, ievadiet der\u012bgu e-pastu.", // EN: Please enter a valid email.
    "Bu e-posta ile zaten bir hesap var. L\u00fctfen giri\u015f yap\u0131n.": "Konts ar \u0161o e-pastu jau past\u0101v. L\u016bdzu, piesakieties.", // EN: An account with this email already exists. Please sign in.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131n\u0131n s\u00fcresi dolmu\u015f ya da ge\u00e7ersiz. L\u00fctfen yeniden dene.": "\u0160\u012b saite ir beigusies vai neder\u012bga. L\u016bdzu, m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz.", // EN: This link has expired or is invalid. Please try again.
    "Bulut hesab\u0131 bu s\u00fcr\u00fcmde kapal\u0131; yerel hesaplarda \u015fifre s\u0131f\u0131rlanamaz.": "M\u0101ko\u0146a konts \u0161aj\u0101 versij\u0101 ir atsp\u0113jots; lok\u0101l\u0101 konta paroles nevar atiestat\u012bt.", // EN: Cloud account is disabled in this build; local account passwords cannot be reset.
    "Bu adres bir hesaba ba\u011fl\u0131ysa s\u0131f\u0131rlama ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131 g\u00f6nderildi. Gelen kutunu (ve gereksiz klas\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fc) kontrol et.": "Ja \u0161\u012b adrese ir saist\u012bta ar kontu, atiestat\u012b\u0161anas saite ir nos\u016bt\u012bta. P\u0101rbaudiet savu ies\u016btni (un surog\u0101tpasta mapi).", // EN: If this address is linked to an account, a reset link has been sent. Check your inbox (and spam folder).
    "\u00c7ok s\u0131k denedin. Bir dakika sonra tekrar dene.": "P\u0101r\u0101k daudz m\u0113\u0123in\u0101jumu. L\u016bdzu, m\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz p\u0113c min\u016btes.", // EN: Too many attempts. Please try again in a minute.
    "Ba\u011flant\u0131 g\u00f6nderilemedi.": "Neizdev\u0101s nos\u016bt\u012bt saiti.", // EN: Could not send the link.
    "Tekrar G\u00f6nder": "Nos\u016bt\u012bt v\u0113lreiz", // EN: Send again
    "\u015eifren g\u00fcncellendi. \u015eimdi giri\u015f yapabilirsin.": "J\u016bsu parole ir atjaunin\u0101ta. Tagad varat ien\u0101kt.", // EN: Your password has been updated. You can sign in now.
    "Mevcut \u015fifreni gir.": "Ievadiet savu pa\u0161reiz\u0113jo paroli.", // EN: Enter your current password.
