    "Son 7 g\u00fcn": "P\u0113d\u0113j\u0101s 7 dienas", // EN: Last 7 days
    "Hen\u00fcz kay\u0131tl\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm yok. G\u00fc\u00e7 \u00f6l\u00e7en bir cihaz ekleyip bu sayfay\u0131 a\u00e7t\u0131\u011f\u0131nda okumalar burada birikir.": "V\u0113l nav ierakst\u012bti m\u0113r\u012bjumi. Pievienojiet ier\u012bci, kas m\u0113ra ener\u0123iju, un atveriet \u0161o lapu; \u0161eit par\u0101d\u012bsies r\u0101d\u012bjumi.", // EN: No measurements recorded yet. Add a device that measures power and open this page; readings will build up here.
    "\u00d6l\u00e7\u00fcm al\u0131nmayan aral\u0131klar hesaba kat\u0131lmaz; bu y\u00fczden de\u011ferler ger\u00e7ek t\u00fcketimden d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck olabilir.": "Interv\u0101li bez m\u0113r\u012bjumiem netiek skait\u012bti, t\u0101p\u0113c v\u0113rt\u012bbas var b\u016bt zem\u0101kas nek\u0101 faktiskais pat\u0113ri\u0146\u0161.", // EN: Intervals without measurements are not counted, so values may be lower than actual consumption.
