    "\u00d6rn. 2,50": "piem., 2,50", // EN: e.g. 2.50
    "Para birimi": "Val\u016bta", // EN: Currency
    "Tahmini maliyet; fatura de\u011fildir. Fiyat yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r.": "Apr\u0113\u0137in\u0101t\u0101s izmaksas, nevis r\u0113\u0137ins. Cena tiek saglab\u0101ta tikai \u0161aj\u0101 ier\u012bc\u0113.", // EN: Estimated cost, not a bill. The price is stored on this device only.
    "G\u00fcnl\u00fck t\u00fcketim, son 7 g\u00fcn (kWh)": "Dienas pat\u0113ri\u0146\u0161, p\u0113d\u0113j\u0101s 7 dienas (kWh)", // EN: Daily usage, last 7 days (kWh)
