    "Cihaz eklenince haz\u0131r senaryolar burada g\u00f6r\u00fcnecek.": "Gatav\u0101s ainas par\u0101d\u012bsies \u0161eit, tikl\u012bdz pievienosiet ier\u012bci.", // EN: Ready-made scenes will appear here once you add a device.
