    "Bu evde cihaz kontrol iznin yok. Ev sahibi izni a\u00e7abilir.": "Jums \u0161aj\u0101 m\u0101j\u0101 nav ier\u012bces vad\u012bbas at\u013caujas. \u012apa\u0161nieks var to iesl\u0113gt.", // EN: You don't have device control permission in this home. The owner can turn it on.
