    "Aile mesajlar\u0131 ve payla\u015f\u0131lan uyar\u0131lar": "\u0122imenes zi\u0146as un koplietotas br\u012bdin\u0101jumi", // EN: Family messages and shared alerts
    "Kritik uyar\u0131lar\u0131 payla\u015f": "Koplietot kritiskos br\u012bdin\u0101jumus", // EN: Share critical alerts
    "Bu cihazdaki g\u00fcvenlik/acil olaylar\u0131n ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve k\u0131sa metni evdeki di\u011fer \u00fcyelerin uygulamas\u0131nda g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Cihaz bilgileri ve anahtarlar payla\u015f\u0131lmaz; her \u00fcye kendi bildirim ayarlar\u0131na tabidir.": "Dro\u0161\u012bbas/av\u0101rijas notikumu nosaukums un \u012bsais teksts par \u0161o ier\u012bci par\u0101d\u0101s citu biedru lietotn\u0113s \u0161aj\u0101 m\u0101j\u0101. Ier\u012bces deta\u013cas un atsl\u0113gas nekad netiek kop\u012bgotas; katrs biedrs seko saviem pazi\u0146ojumu iestat\u012bjumiem.", // EN: The title and short text of security/emergency events on this device appear in other members' apps in this home. Device details and keys are never shared; every member follows their own notification settings.
    "Evden Ayr\u0131l": "Atst\u0101t m\u0101ju", // EN: Leave Home
    "Ayr\u0131l": "Pamest", // EN: Leave
    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Ievadiet kodu no uzaicin\u0101juma e-pasta. Kods ir vienreiz lietojams un darbojas tikai ar uzaicin\u0101t\u0101 e-pasta adresi.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
    "Oturum gerekli": "Nepiecie\u0161ama piesl\u0113g\u0161an\u0101s", // EN: Sign-in required
    "\u00dcye davet etmek i\u00e7in \u00f6nce oturum a\u00e7; evin hesab\u0131na otomatik ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Piesakieties vispirms, lai uzaicin\u0101tu dal\u012bbniekus; j\u016bs autom\u0101tiski tiksiet piesl\u0113gts sava m\u0101jok\u013ca kontam.", // EN: Sign in first to invite members; you'll be connected to your home's account automatically.
    "E-posta sunucudan g\u00f6nderilemedi": "E-pastu nevar\u0113ja nos\u016bt\u012bt no servera", // EN: The email couldn't be sent from the server
    "Davet olu\u015fturuldu ama otomatik e-posta g\u00f6nderilemedi. Kendi posta uygulamanla davet metnini haz\u0131rlayal\u0131m m\u0131?": "Uzaicin\u0101jums tika izveidots, ta\u010du autom\u0101tiskais e-pasts netika nos\u016bt\u012bts. Vai sagatavojam uzaicin\u0101juma tekstu j\u016bsu e-pasta lietotn\u0113?", // EN: The invite was created but the automatic email couldn't be sent. Shall we prepare the invitation text with your own mail app?
    "Posta Uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 A\u00e7": "Atv\u0113rt e-pasta lietotni", // EN: Open Mail App
    "I\u015f\u0131k d\u00fczeyi": "Gaismas l\u012bmenis", // EN: Light level
    "Bas\u0131n\u00e7": "Spiediens", // EN: Pressure
    "Hareket alg\u0131land\u0131": "Detekt\u0113ta kust\u012bba", // EN: Motion detected
    "Hareket yok": "Nav kust\u012bbas", // EN: No motion
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Neizdev\u0101s izveidot savienojumu ar ier\u012bci. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka t\u0101 ir taj\u0101 pa\u0161\u0101 t\u012bkl\u0101.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network.
    "Cihaza ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan, IP adresinin ve yerel anahtar\u0131n do\u011fru oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "Neizdev\u0101s izveidot savienojumu ar ier\u012bci. P\u0101rliecinieties, ka t\u0101 ir taj\u0101 pa\u0161\u0101 t\u012bkl\u0101 un ka IP adrese un lok\u0101lais atsl\u0113gas kods ir pareizi.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the device. Make sure it's on the same network and that the IP address and local key are correct.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 s\u0131cak tonda a\u00e7ar, perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 yapar.": "Iesl\u0113dz gaismas silt\u0101 ton\u012b, atver aizkarus un iestata kondicionieri uz 22\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the lights on in a warm tone, opens the curtains and sets the AC to 22°.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve perdeleri a\u00e7ar, klimay\u0131 22\u00b0 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi \u015farja g\u00f6nderir.": "Iesl\u0113dz gaismas un atver aizkarus, iestata kondicionieri uz 22\u00b0 un nos\u016bta putek\u013cs\u016bc\u0113ju atpaka\u013c uz uzl\u0101di.", // EN: Turns on the lights and opens the curtains, runs the AC at 22° and sends the vacuum back to charge.
    "I\u015f\u0131k, TV ve klimay\u0131 kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Izsl\u0113dz gaismas, televizoru un kondicionieri, aizver aizkarus un aizsl\u0113dz durvis.", // EN: Turns off the lights, TV and AC, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler.": "Izsl\u0113dz gaismas un TV, aizver aizkarus un aizsl\u0113dz durvis.", // EN: Turns off the lights and TV, closes the curtains and locks the door.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %15 s\u0131cak tona getirir, perdeleri kapat\u0131r, TV'yi a\u00e7ar.": "Iestata gaismas silt\u0101 ton\u012b 15% spilgtum\u0101, aizver aizkarus un iesl\u0113dz TV.", // EN: Sets the lights to a warm tone at 15%, closes the curtains and turns on the TV.
    "Kap\u0131y\u0131 kilitler, perdeleri kapat\u0131r.": "Aizsl\u0113dz durvis un aizver aizkarus.", // EN: Locks the door and closes the curtains.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %70 parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Iesl\u0113dz gaismas 70% spilgtum\u0101.", // EN: Turns the lights on at 70% brightness.
    "Robot s\u00fcp\u00fcrgeyi ba\u015flat\u0131r.": "S\u0101k robotu putek\u013cs\u016bc\u0113ju.", // EN: Starts the robot vacuum.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 10:00": "Darba dien\u0101s 10:00", // EN: Weekdays 10:00
    "Klimay\u0131 ve termostat\u0131 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir, hava temizleyiciyi \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r.": "Iestata AC un termostatu uz komforta re\u017e\u012bmu un iesl\u0113dz gaisa att\u012br\u012bt\u0101ju.", // EN: Sets the AC and thermostat to the comfort setting and runs the air purifier.
    "Bildirim g\u00f6nderir": "Nos\u016bta pazi\u0146ojumu", // EN: Sends a notification
    "Bu senaryo mevcut cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 etkilemiyor. Senaryonun \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 i\u00e7in uygun bir cihaz (\u00f6r. \u0131\u015f\u0131k, perde, s\u00fcp\u00fcrge) eklemelisin.": "\u0160is scen\u0101rijs neietekm\u0113 nevienu no j\u016bsu pa\u0161reiz\u0113jiem ier\u012bc\u0113m. Lai tas darbotos, pievienojiet atbilsto\u0161u ier\u012bci (piem., gaismu, aizkaru vai putek\u013cs\u016bc\u0113ju).", // EN: This scenario doesn't affect any of your current devices. To make it work, add a suitable device (e.g. a light, curtain or vacuum).
    "Yeni bir ev olu\u015ftur ya da sana g\u00f6nderilen davet koduyla bir eve kat\u0131l.": "Izveidojiet jaunu m\u0101ju vai pievienojieties tai, izmantojot jums nos\u016bt\u012bto uzaicin\u0101juma kodu.", // EN: Create a new home, or join one with the invite code sent to you.
    "Oturum a\u00e7\u0131k de\u011fil. Evler yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda tutulur. \u00dcye davet etmek, bir eve kat\u0131lmak ve aile sohbeti i\u00e7in oturum a\u00e7.": "J\u016bs neesat pierakst\u012bjies. M\u0101jas tiek glab\u0101tas tikai \u0161aj\u0101 ier\u012bc\u0113. Pierakstieties, lai aicin\u0101tu dal\u012bbniekus, pievienotos m\u0101jai un lietotu \u0123imenes t\u0113rz\u0113\u0161anu.", // EN: You're not signed in. Homes are kept on this device only. Sign in to invite members, join a home and use the family chat.
    "Shelly 1 / 1PM R\u00f6le": "Shelly 1 / 1PM Relejs", // EN: Shelly 1 / 1PM Relay
