    "Yerel \u015fifreli HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 TP-Link hesab\u0131 e-postas\u0131 + \u015fifresiyle, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller (kamera ve enerji \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcm\u00fc hen\u00fcz yok)": "Viet\u0113jais \u0161ifr\u0113tais HTTP (KLAP) \u2014 ar j\u016bsu TP-Link konta e-pastu + paroli, darbvirsmas lietotn\u0113; kontaktligzdas, sl\u0113d\u017ei un spuldzes (kamera un ener\u0123ijas uzskaites funkcija v\u0113l nav pieejama)", // EN: Local encrypted HTTP (KLAP) — with your TP-Link account email + password, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs (camera and energy metering not available yet)
