    "Yerel LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u015fifreli TCP) \u2014 \u00fccretsiz Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131nan cihaz kimli\u011fi + yerel anahtarla, masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda; priz, anahtar ve ampuller": "Viet\u0113jais LAN (3.3 / 3.4, \u0161ifr\u0113ts TCP) \u2014 ar ier\u012bces ID + viet\u0113jo atsl\u0113gu no bezmaksas Tuya IoT konta, darbvirsmas lietotn\u0113; kontaktligzdas, sl\u0113d\u017ei un spuldzes", // EN: Local LAN (3.3 / 3.4, encrypted TCP) — with the device ID + local key from a free Tuya IoT account, in the desktop app; plugs, switches and bulbs
