    "Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like \"lights\" or \"plugs\". Your paired devices: {0}.": "Kuru ier\u012bci es izsl\u0113dzu? Izmantojiet ier\u012bces nosaukumu, istabu vai tipu, piem\u0113ram, \"gaismas\" vai \"rozetes\". J\u016bsu piesaist\u012bt\u0101s ier\u012bces: {0}.", // EN: Which device should I turn off? Use a device name, a room or a type like "lights" or "plugs". Your paired devices: {0}.
