    "The {0} scene does not change any of your paired devices, so I did not save it. Try again after adding a suitable device.": "{0} aina nemaina nevienu no j\u016bsu piesaist\u012btaj\u0101m ier\u012bc\u0113m, t\u0101p\u0113c es to nesaglab\u0101ju. M\u0113\u0123iniet v\u0113lreiz p\u0113c piem\u0113rotas ier\u012bces pievieno\u0161anas.", // EN: The {0} scene does not change any of your paired devices, so I did not save it. Try again after adding a suitable device.
    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Es izveidoju \"{0}\" automatiz\u0101ciju: t\u0101 darbojas {1} un piel\u0101go {2} ier\u012bces. Automatiz\u0101cijas darbojas, kam\u0113r lietotne ir atv\u0113rta (ar\u012b no sist\u0113mas teknes dator\u0101).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} devices. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
    "I set up the \"{0}\" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).": "Es izveidoju \"{0}\" autom\u0101tiku: t\u0101 darbojas {1} un piel\u0101go {2} ier\u012bci. Autom\u0101tikas darbojas, kam\u0113r lietotne ir atv\u0113rta (ar\u012b no sist\u0113mas teknes datora versij\u0101).", // EN: I set up the "{0}" automation: it runs {1} and adjusts {2} device. Automations run while the app is open (also from the tray on desktop).
    "I added \"{0}\" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.": "Es pievienoju \"{0}\" piesk\u0101rienam, lai palaistu; viens piesk\u0101riens piel\u0101go {1} ier\u012bces.", // EN: I added "{0}" to Tap to Run; one tap adjusts {1} devices.
