    "There is no subscription to manage on this account. If you want to join NEXUS+, you can do it from the Plus page.": "\u0160im kontam nav abonementa, ko p\u0101rvald\u012bt. Ja v\u0113lies pievienoties NEXUS+, to vari izdar\u012bt Plus lap\u0101.", // EN: There is no subscription to manage on this account. If you want to join NEXUS+, you can do it from the Plus page.
